Source distribution and file hashes are recorded in provenance.json.

M5 changes:
- Only the 12Hz codec model/configuration are included. No Qwen language model,
  25Hz codec, Gradio application or qwen-tts package metadata is included.
- modeling_qwen3_tts_tokenizer_v2.py adapts the check_model_inputs decorator
  for the project's fixed Transformers 4.57.6 version. Tensor operations and
  codec architecture are unchanged.
- __init__.py is an M5 adapter for local files/NumPy waveforms and code tensors;
  it preserves the upstream encode/decode processing used by M5 inference.

Codec weights are downloaded separately and retain their upstream license.
